{"version":1,"content":"<p>在系統出現故障數小時後，微軟公司仍在努力恢復部分辦公軟件的訪問，稱用户可能仍然無法連接到電子郵件和聊天服務等產品。周四，部分用户在美國工作日的大部分時間裏都無法使用Outlook、Teams和Copilot人工智能服務。微軟的產品是企業、政府和教育機構中最廣泛使用的軟件之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586198.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.106042+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:53:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"2d9f167fd04e7cfebec314ab0fc49567d927f183d25bb8ef4230d24103017ef5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}